 Chang Gung Memorial Hospital","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210120917","name":"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company (Taiwan)","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210121532","name":"Ministry of Health and Welfare","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210126829","name":"China Medical University Hospital","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210131804","name":"National Taiwan University Hospital","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210135784","name":"Institute of Atomic and Molecular Sciences, Academia Sinica","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210136969","name":"Institute of Molecular Biology, Academia Sinica","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"US","id":"I4210137306","name":"Stanford Medicine","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210142271","name":"Wan Fang Hospital","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4210158385","name":"Taipei Medical University-Shuang Ho Hospital","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"CN","id":"I4405256935","name":"Zhangjiang Laboratory","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"CN","id":"I4405280835","name":"Zhanjiang University of Science and Technology","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I47519274","name":"Taipei Medical University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I4880106","name":"Feng Chia University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"US","id":"I74973139","name":"Carnegie Mellon University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"US","id":"I78577930","name":"Columbia University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"CN","id":"I79223203","name":"Guangdong Ocean University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I84653119","name":"Academia Sinica","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I87354575","name":"National Chengchi University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I882009436","name":"Central Taiwan University of Science and Technology","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I91807558","name":"National Cheng Kung University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"CN","id":"I96852419","name":"Capital Normal University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"US","id":"I97018004","name":"Stanford University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I99613584","name":"National Taipei University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"TW","id":"I99908691","name":"Yuan Ze University","source":"openalex_last_known"}],"rising_pct":null,"rising_score":null,"work_count":1,"work_ids":["W7163038666"]},"schema_version":"s3.1","works":[{"abstract":"Microplastics (MPs), by-products of the fragmentation and degradation of plastic products, are widespread environmental contaminants, yet their functional consequences for developing immunity remain unknown. Here we report a comprehensive characterization of microplastics in surgically excised pediatric tonsils ( n = 30) using pyrolysis gas chromatography\u2013mass spectrometry (Py-GC/MS) and Nile Red fluorescence microscopy. Py-GC/MS reports polymer mass and does not report particle size. Nile Red microscopy supports microplastics. A nanoplastic component is inferred and is not directly sized in this study. Py-GC/MS detected polymer mass in all specimens, with polyethylene terephthalate, acrylonitrile butadiene styrene, and polyethylene the most frequently detected polymers, found in 97%, 90%, and 83% of samples, respectively. Polystyrene was among the additional polymers detected. We performed two exposure experiments in human lymphoid aggregate culture (HLAC) tonsil organoids. Functional cytokine modules spanning immune, metabolic, structural, and growth factor pathways showed coordinated deviation from controls at day 3 post-exposure with subsequent normalization. Fluorescence-guided depth profiling demonstrated time-dependent penetration of 100 nm particles into organoid aggregates (70% tissue depth at day 3 versus 95% at day 14). These findings establish pediatric tonsils as a sentinel tissue for microplastic accumulation and demonstrate that a tissue-profile-informed polymer mixture elicits transient but significant immunomodulatory responses in human lymphoid tissue in an ex vivo model, with implications for mucosal and systemic immune health in children that remain to be established clinically.","author_count":15,"author_ids":["A5015595722","A5022444518","A5039497136","A5042231568","A5083437044","A5087595212","A5092974728","A5111690381","A5126703410","A5135072795","A5135092863","A5137430624","A5137559060","A5137588000","A5137593863"],"author_institution_ids":["I148366613","I4210137306","I97018004"],"authors":[{"id":"A5137593863","name":"Amirbahador Golchin Sani Masouleh"},{"id":"A5126703410","name":"Antony Georgiadis"},{"id":"A5137588000","name":"Maggie H Zhang"},{"id":"A5083437044","name":"Yi\u2010Cheng Lin"},{"id":"A5092974728","name":"Isha Kandlikar"},{"id":"A5022444518","name":"Patrick Timothy Kiessling"},{"id":"A5087595212","name":"Mitra A. Alikhani"},{"id":"A5137430624","name":"Andrea Miranda"},{"id":"A5039497136","name":"Nathan J. Alves"},{"id":"A5135072795","name":"Alex Bindemann"},{"id":"A5135092863","name":"Anushri Umesh"},{"id":"A5042231568","name":"Matthew J. Campen"},{"id":"A5111690381","name":"Robert Taylor"},{"id":"A5137559060","name":"Stacey Harper"},{"id":"A5015595722","name":"Kara D. Meister"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":true,"cited_by_count":0,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44454-026-00068-8","domain_tags":["analytical_methods","fate_transport_and_sorption","occurrence_and_monitoring"],"facet_tags":[],"institution_ids":["I131249849","I148366613","I157725225","I169521973","I219193219","I4210137306","I4394709130","I97018004"],"is_oa":true,"journal":"npj Emerging Contaminants","last_updated":"2026-11-26T09:34:50.682384","license":"cc-by-nc-nd","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"gold","oa_url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44454-026-00068-8.pdf","openalex_topics":["T10419","T10753","T14072"],"plastic_related":true,"plastic_tier":"core","primary_topic":"T10753","pub_date":"2026-11-23","study_type":"article","title":"Microplastics in pediatric tonsil tissue: distribution and immunomodulatory effects in human lymphoid aggregate organoids","type":"article","work_id":"W7163038666","year":2026}]}
